---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="The choice begins with understanding" description="A moment to consider what understanding AI makes possible." bodyClass="intro-body">
  <main id="content" class="intro-stage">
    <div class="intro-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="intro-planet" aria-hidden="true"><div class="intro-horizon"></div></div>
    <div class="intro-center">
      <a href="/" class="intro-brand" aria-label="AI in Perspective museum hall">AI <span>in Perspective</span></a>
      <div class="intro-message" aria-label="Opening statement">
        <p class="intro-line intro-line--first">The wave isn't coming.<br /><strong>It's already here.</strong></p>
        <p class="intro-line">You can choose to ignore it. You can resist it, fear it, or close yourself off from it. Or you can choose to understand it, explore what it makes possible, and empower yourself with it.</p>
        <p class="intro-line">There are real risks, and they deserve to be taken seriously. Because the truth is, <em>right now</em>, AI is less something to fear and more something to be excited about.</p>
        <p class="intro-line">You don't have to embrace everything about AI to recognize its potential. And you don't have to ignore its risks to be optimistic about its future.</p>
        <p class="intro-line intro-line--final">The choice begins with <em>understanding.</em></p>
      </div>
      <a href="/" class="intro-continue">Continue to the museum <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <a href="/" class="intro-skip">Skip introduction <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <span class="intro-caption" aria-hidden="true">PERSPECTIVE BEGINS HERE</span>
  </main>
  <script>
    // Keep the action visible without waiting for animation. Motion never blocks entry.
    const stage = document.querySelector(".intro-stage");
    stage?.classList.add("intro-ready");
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
